{
  "_comment": "翻译后端池。model 是实例的 --served-model-name（问一句就知道: curl -H 'Authorization: Bearer <key>' <api_base 去掉 /chat/completions>/models）。api_base 必须是完整的 /v1/chat/completions，只写到 /v1 会 404。调度只看 concurrency：每个后端起这么多线程，从同一个队列里抢任务，快的后端自然抢得多，不需要手动配权重（weight 字段留着兼容，实际不参与调度）。某个后端连续失败 disable_backend_after_failures 次会被摘掉，剩下的继续跑。",
  "request_timeout": 300,
  "max_retries": 2,
  "disable_backend_after_failures": 20,
  "backends": [
    {
      "name": "vllm-8001",
      "_gpu": "GPU 0,1",
      "api_base": "http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions",
      "model": "Qwen3.8-27B",
      "api_key": "local-pool-key",
      "concurrency": 64,
      "weight": 1,
      "extra_body": {
        "chat_template_kwargs": {
          "enable_thinking": false
        }
      }
    },
